  "details": "I just want to ask for a mode where you can toggle your ability to interact with objects, doors, etc.\nIt can have a little switch in the settings and can have a sign that shows on your hud when you have it turned on so you won’t get confused if you forgot you have it on.\n\nSeats are a big one I’m aiming at when making this, it would be so much easier to just toggle this little mode and be able to do emotes on top of pillows, in front of doors, on a couch etc.\n\nJust a quality of life thing that just seems nice.",
